<h1>MCC Scots Athletics</h1>
<div class="attention callout">
<div class="row">
<div class="large-6 columns">
<p><strong>The Athletics Department provides:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Eight competitive sports</li>
<li>Student-Athlete Academic Advising</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="large-6 columns lbrdr">
<p><strong>See us when you:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Have questions regarding joining a team</li>
<li>Have questions regarding eligibility for participation</li>
<li>Would like to speak to our Student-Athlete Academic Success Coordinator</li>
<li>Are a student-athlete and have class scheduling questions/issues</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Intercollegiate athletics is an important part of student life at MCC. MCC teams compete in eight intercollegiate sports through their membership in the Illinois Skyway Collegiate Conference and the <a href="https://www.njcaa.org/landing/index">National Junior College Athletic Association</a>.</p>
<p><a class="button arrow large" href="https://mccscots.com/">Visit the MCC Scots Athletics website</a></p>
<h2>MCC Athletic Programs</h2>
<div class="row gbrdr">
<div class="large-6 columns">
<h3>Women's Sports</h3>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://mccscots.com/sports/wbkb/index">Basketball</a></li>
<li><a href="https://mccscots.com/sports/sball/index">Softball</a></li>
<li><a href="https://mccscots.com/sports/wten/index">Tennis</a></li>
<li><a href="https://mccscots.com/sports/wvball/index">Volleyball</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="large-6 columns">
<h3>Men's Sports</h3>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://mccscots.com/sports/bsb/index">Baseball</a></li>
<li><a href="https://mccscots.com/sports/mbkb/index">Basketball</a></li>
<li><a href="https://mccscots.com/sports/msoc/index">Soccer</a></li>
<li><a href="https://mccscots.com/sports/mten/index">Tennis</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="large-6 columns">
<h2>Contact Athletics</h2>
<div class="cal-info">
<p class="address"><a href="https://map.concept3d.com/?id=84#!m/603650?share" rel="noopener" target="_blank">A109 <span class="show-for-sr">(opens in new tab)</span></a></p>
<p class="email"><a href="mailto:athletics@mchenry.edu">Athletics@mchenry.edu</a></p>
<p class="contact"><a href="tel:815-455-8580">(815) 455-8580</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
